<span class=\"dur\">58:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">科技乱炖</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1122</span></div>\n<h2>DeepSeek 限流不是省钱，是在算力上追不上美国的无奈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">DeepSeek 对 C 端限流的真实原因不是省钱，而是国产卡在数量和代差上远落后海外头部厂商，模型公司宁可把卡收回去做训练也不愿服务普通用户。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">国产芯片</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"First principles: What it takes to be a great product manager in the AI era | Sherif Mansour PM craft triangle artist PM AI builder bolting on AI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-22-lennys-ai时代pm不该写代码-吞吐量不再是瓶颈-方向才是/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9ceda05f276677fa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:21:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1122</span></div>\n<h2>AI时代PM不该写代码：吞吐量不再是瓶颈，方向才是</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Atlassian把PM、设计师都变成「AI builder」做实验，一个月后团队自己放弃了这种模式——因为AI让产出变快了，但没人知道该往哪划船。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">产品管理</span><span class=\"tag\">AI组织转型</span>\n</div></div></a>"]